My family is going through a hard time. There are seven people in my family. My parents make a living by farming. They are the only source of income for our whole family. My younger brother and sister are still studying at school. We also need to look after my elderly grandparents.We are facing financial trouble now, and we hope to get some help to get through this difficult period. Every little kindness can bring hope to our family. We will be thankful forever for any support.